          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Deadly Deception"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Skartitch attempts a Deception check to Feint against an opponent she can see. On a success, Skartitch can immediately Strike with one unarmed attack and one ranged weapon attack against the target. The ranged attack does not trigger reactions from the target of the Feint. Both of these attacks count toward her multiple attack penalty, but do not apply the penalty until both attacks are completed."
            },
